OL,3,ABurnham says youth employment and
OL,4,Atraining crisis is a 'moral failure'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLater this week, the government is
OL,7,Fexpected to announce plans to give
OL,8,Fyoung people thousands of job
OL,9,Fopportunities. The Conservative Party
OL,10,Fhas labelled the government's youth
OL,11,Femployment strategy "a disaster".
